{"seq":1,"slug":"scientific-method","title":"科学方法","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/ideas-and-methods/scientific-method","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"patient-observation-and-experiment","title":"耐心的观察与实验","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/ideas-and-methods/scientific-method/patient-observation-and-experiment","wordCount":1739,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"one-long-argument","title":"\"一个长论证\"","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/ideas-and-methods/scientific-method/one-long-argument","wordCount":1490,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"科学方法\">科学方法</h1><p>本章剖析达尔文的研究方法。他的成功不在于某次灵光乍现，而在于一种把海量观察与实验，编织成严密论证的能力。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述他长期、耐心的观察与实验风格——从八年研究藤壶到晚年观察蚯蚓。第二篇文档分析《物种起源》作为&quot;一个长论证&quot;的结构：他如何以归纳与类比层层推进，使理论难以反驳。</p>\n"}